# The repo root is ~/Downloads, which is also where the browser drops
# everything. So: ignore all top-level entries by default, then allow
# back only the files and folders that make up theorya.ai.

/*

# Site files at the root
!.gitignore
!CNAME
!_headers
!index.html
!robots.txt
!sitemap.xml

# Site folders
!images/
!manifesto/
!provocations/
!signals/
!theory/

# Source documents that may end up inside a site folder but should not ship
*.docx
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.pptx
*.zip
.DS_Store
